{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"edits\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕自己表现得太在乎，会让对方觉得累，所以只敢露出一点点。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"op\": \"delete\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他一时只顾着享受这份亲近，连下一步该怎样都懒得想。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-2+S03-3\",\n      \"op\": \"merge\",\n      \"text\": \"安静下来时，他才发现还有些心思没敢让对方知道。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"op\": \"delete\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他终于没再把自己有多在乎藏得那么严，让对方看见了。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"op\": \"delete\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"那阵轻快还在，他却忽然安静下来，暂时不再往后想了。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他忽然觉得，眼下对方还愿意这样亲近自己，就已经很好了，先别忙着想以后。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"可他也明白，自己再怎么对对方好，也不能保证对方以后还会像现在这样靠近自己，想到这里，他忽然疼得厉害。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1+S12-2\",\n      \"op\": \"merge\",\n      \"text\": \"想到自己也能让对方踏实下来，他便只想把能给的好都给对方，幸福得发疼。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-3+S12-4\",\n      \"op\": \"merge\",\n      \"text\": \"他还是贪心地想要更多日子，却不再跟这股欢喜较劲，只管痛痛快快地爱这一回。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他明知谁也给不了以后准话，可越想到有一天会失去，越想把眼前这份喜欢全都给出去。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他这回不是怕自己表现得太多会让对方为难，而是怕有一天对方不再像现在这样靠近自己，那时他会疼得受不了。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"op\": \"delete\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他最终还是决定，不把已经让对方看见的喜欢再藏回去，哪怕谁也不能保证以后。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"note\": \"删减前半段重复的犹豫和预先伤感，压缩 S03、S12 的重复表达，调整几处心理分析式措辞，并让 S13 从退缩转为害怕失去却仍想全心付出的强烈情绪。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "714d5a3e-c9f2-44a9-8181-84b7c78cad59", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261103T070951714083Z", "elapsed_seconds": 403.891, "completed_utc": "2026-11-03T07:16:35.619731+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8ee79d879366d2f7885ca6b4679aa5f0865eeabc7bdcd17d0406564393cb4377", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261103T070951714083Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "75f8424d3584e4413875a561a7c7dc7a6bc700bc7969c16f236f5adbfd4e82b9"}}}
